title: "OLLMU: Optical Large Language Model Unit — a concept paper on a passive diffractive ROM with slow-light side loops and interference routing"
message: Preserve originator credit if you use this concept. Implementation is not restricted.
type: software
license: other
license-url: https://github.com/ussdeveloper/OLLMU/blob/main/LICENSE
